error[E0915]: the macro `scale` can't be part of the operator set `*`
  --> tests/ui/macro_operators.wid:34:14
   |
26 | macro def scale(v: Code, by: Code) -> Code
   |           ----- declared with `macro def` here
...
34 | overload :*, :scale, :scale_v
   |              ^^^^^^ a macro in an operator's set
   = note: operators are methods of types, which the program runs; a macro only expands where it is called by name
help: list `def`s in `*`, which may call the macro, or call the macro by its own name
   = see `wid explain E0915`

